# {{projectName}}

Built with Angular + Standalone Components architecture.

## Stack
- **Framework:** Angular (standalone components, no NgModules)
- **Language:** TypeScript
{{#if useMaterial}}
- **UI:** Angular Material
{{/if}}
{{#if useTailwind}}
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS 4
{{/if}}
{{#if useTests}}
- **Unit tests:** Jest + jest-preset-angular
{{/if}}
{{#if useE2E}}
- **E2E tests:** Playwright
{{/if}}

## Commands
```bash
npm start        # Start dev server
npm run build    # Production build
{{#if useTests}}
npm test         # Run unit tests
{{/if}}
{{#if useE2E}}
npm run test:e2e # Run E2E tests
{{/if}}
{{#if useLint}}
npm run lint     # Lint code
npm run format   # Format code
{{/if}}
```

## Project Structure
```
src/
  app/
    app.component.ts       # Root component
    {{#each modules}}
    {{this}}/
      {{this}}.component.ts      # {{pascalCase this}} standalone component
      {{this}}.component.spec.ts # {{pascalCase this}} tests
    {{/each}}
  environments/      # Environment configs
  index.html         # HTML shell
  main.ts            # Bootstrap (standalone API)
  styles.css         # Global styles
```
